OL,3,ASurvivors and families to speak at
OL,4,Aceremony on UK's first national day for
OL,5,Avictims of terror
OL,6,
OL,7,FToday is the UK's first national day
OL,8,Ffor those impacted by terrorism,
OL,9,Fincluding survivors and their families,
OL,10,Fwitnesses and the emergency services
OL,12,FThere will be a ceremony for victims of
OL,13,Fterror, and readings from people
OL,14,Faffected by it, in London this
OL,15,Fafternoon - you'll be able to watch
OL,16,Flive above
OL,18,FA two-minute silence will be observed
OL,19,Fto remember those lost to terrorism
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
