OL,3,ASurvivors and families to speak at
OL,4,Aceremony on UK's first national day for
OL,5,Avictims of terror
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn art installation, made of 1,000
OL,8,Fpaper cranes, has been set up at the
OL,9,Fceremony
OL,11,FFigen Murray, the mother of a man
OL,12,Fkilled in the Manchester Arena bombing,
OL,13,Fsays the event will "bring people
OL,14,Ftogether who often feel isolated"
